2C%20a%20zero%20result%20keeping%20the%20sign%20of%20the%20argument.%20-%2F%0Adef%20ml_trunc%20%28x%20%3A%20Float%29%20%3A%20Float%20%3A%3D%20if%20x%20%3C%200%20then%20x.ceil%20else%20x.floor%0A%2F--%20Math.round%3A%20the%20nearest%20integer%2C%20the%20one%20towards%20%2BInfinity%20on%20a%20tie%2C%20and%20-0%20from%20-0.5%20up%20to%200.%20-%2F%0Adef%20ml_round%20%28x%20%3A%20Float%29%20%3A%20Float%20%3A%3D%0A%20%20if%20x.isNaN%20%7C%7C%20x.isInf%20%7C%7C%20x%20%3D%3D%200%20then%20x%0A%20%20else%20if%20x%20%3E%200%20%E2%88%A7%20x%20%3C%200.5%20then%200%0A%20%20else%20if%20x%20%3C%200%20%E2%88%A7%20x%20%E2%89%A5%20-0.5%20then%20-0.0%0A%20%20else%20if%20x%20-%20x.floor%20%E2%89%A5%200.5%20then%20x.floor%20%2B%201%20else%20x.floor%0A%2F--%20Math.sign%3A%201%20or%20-1%2C%20and%20-0%2C%200%20and%20NaN%20as%20they%20are.%20-%2F%0Adef%20ml_sign%20%28x%20%3A%20Float%29%20%3A%20Float%20%3A%3D%20if%20x%20%3E%200%20then%201%20else%20if%20x%20%3C%200%20then%20-1%20else%20x%0A%2F--%20Math.max%20of%20two%20Numbers%3A%20NaN%20when%20either%20is%2C%20and%200%20above%20-0.%20-%2F%0Adef%20ml_max%20%28a%20b%20%3A%20Float%29%20%3A%20Float%20%3A%3D%0A%20%20if%20a%20%3E%20b%20then%20a%20else%20if%20b%20%3E%20a%20then%20b%20else%20if%20a%20%3D%3D%20b%20then%20%28if%201%20%2F%20a%20%3C%200%20then%20b%20else%20a%29%20else%200.0%20%2F%200.0%0A%2F--%20Math.min%20of%20two%20Numbers%3A%20NaN%20when%20either%20is%2C%20and%20-0%20below%200.%20-%2F%0Adef%20ml_min%20%28a%20b%20%3A%20Float%29%20%3A%20Float%20%3A%3D%0A%20%20if%20a%20%3C%20b%20then%20a%20else%20if%20b%20%3C%20a%20then%20b%20else%20if%20a%20%3D%3D%20b%20then%20%28if%201%20%2F%20a%20%3C%200%20then%20a%20else%20b%29%20else%200.0%20%2F%200.0%0Adef%20ml_is_integer%20%28x%20%3A%20Float%29%20%3A%20Bool%20%3A%3D%20x.isFinite%20%26%26%20ml_trunc%20x%20%3D%3D%20x%0Adef%20ml_is_safe_integer%20%28x%20%3A%20Float%29%20%3A%20Bool%20%3A%3D%20ml_is_integer%20x%20%26%26%20decide%20%28x.abs%20%E2%89%A4%209007199254740991%29%0A%0Adef%20acceptJavaScriptWh